From dbabd50c19c5bb3b0573bf69a0e1436c48a0a743 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oxjmo <oxjmo@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 00:25:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] GPU: Adreno 630 (dipper) full 22-step chain boots and
 renders; WCN3990 bring-up progress

mi8_adreno.c + a630_hw_init.inc bring the A630 up step by step under
mi8gpu=N. With skipmode avoiding the four write-walled shader registers,
the whole chain now survives every round: GMU firmware, HFI, 3D core
power, CP execution -- and the CP's screen fill (2.4M dwords in 405
submissions) really reaches the panel. TrustZone offers no PAS 13, so
zap authentication is left behind; secure mode does not stop the CP.

redwood_adreno.c delegates to mi8 when the GPU is kept; wcn3990 carries
the modem-PIL era instrumentation and step gating.
---
